@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #243247
skinparam ArrowColor #53657A
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #E2EDFC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BDAA65
hide footbox
title Editing a trip: validation before mutation
participant "app: TripJio" as App #E8EDF3
participant "command: TripEditCommand" as Cmd #E2EDFC
participant "book: TripBook" as Book #E3F3EF
participant "trip: Trip" as Trip #E3F3EF
participant "storage: Storage" as Storage #FBE7D5
note over App, Cmd
  Parser and TripCommandParser have validated the input
  and constructed the command. Routine getters and UI calls are omitted.
end note
activate App
App -> Cmd ++ : execute(state, ui)
Cmd -> Book ++ : edit(index, name, start, end)
Book -> Book ++ : checkIndex(index)
Book --> Book --
Book -> Book ++ : validateName(name, position)
Book --> Book --
Book -> Trip ++ : set(combinedStart, combinedEnd)
note right of Trip : Validate both dates\nbefore changing either.
Trip --> Book --
note right of Book : Rename only after date validation succeeds.\nRetain the same Trip and selection.
Book --> Cmd --
Cmd --> App -- : success
App -> Cmd ++ : isMutating()
Cmd --> App -- : true
App -> Storage ++ : save(state)
Storage --> App --
deactivate App
note over App, Storage
  Successful path shown. Validation errors unwind to the main loop:
  display an error and skip saving. A later I/O save failure
  does not roll back the in-memory change.
end note
@enduml
